## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Sustain Default (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Queen's Wings, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against sustain EXP laners, attack-speed cores, or shield-heavy drafts that keep hitting you during mark loops.; Radiant Armor over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when repeated magic poke is stopping you from walking into the second cast and ultimate reset.; Antique Cuirass over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against physical skill burst that must spend cooldowns into you before your team can follow.
- Total cost: 10900 gold

Default ranked EXP setup that keeps Phoveus alive long enough to recycle marks, shields, and lost-HP recovery in extended fights.

### EXP Anti-Sustain Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, War Axe, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, War Axe
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when control duration or magic lane pressure matters more than early physical trading.; Queen's Wings over Thunder Belt when Use when you need more low-HP damage reduction and cooldown cycling instead of a slower tank stack path.; Brute Force Breastplate over Oracle when Use when the fight is about sticking through movement and crowd control rather than amplifying shields and recovery.
- Total cost: 10630 gold

Tankier EXP profile for physical or sustain-heavy drafts where Phoveus must front the first contact and apply anti-heal early.

### EXP Catch and Peel (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Oracle, Dominance Ice, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Queen's Wings, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Rupture, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Brute Force Breastplate over Dominance Ice when Use when the enemy lacks lifesteal or attack speed and you need more movement through repeated skirmishes.; Winter Crown over Immortality when Use against predictable burst windows when stasis buys more value than a delayed revive.; Radiant Armor over Dominance Ice when Use into repeated magic damage where anti-heal is less important than surviving the walk-in.
- Total cost: 11040 gold

Catch-focused build that keeps the sustain core while using Flameshot as extra peel, displacement, or a long-range mark setup.

